Orlan Editor patch to the Collabora Online browser code. build.sh applies it after the
clone, and the build stops if it does not apply.

- About box: names Collabora Online as the MPL-2.0 source, keeps the upstream copyright
  notices, and links to the source of this build.
- Help tab and Help menu: no Forum and no Report an issue entries, which open Collabora sites.
- Calc formula error menu: no "Help on this error" entry, which opens a Collabora site.
- Proxy error message: no link to the Collabora SDK documentation.

